      <span style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:12px;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;background:rgba(240,168,96,0.18);color:#F0A860;border:1px solid rgba(240,168,96,0.3);">Service Area</span>
