      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Serving the acreage and horse country of north Marion County, from the US 301 corridor out to Orange Lake. Free written estimates and straight answers from a local crew.</p>
